<rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>go-slides – Security</title><link>https://go-slides.github.io/docs/0.14/tags/security/</link><description>Recent content in Security on go-slides</description><generator>Hugo -- gohugo.io</generator><language>en</language><atom:link href="https://go-slides.github.io/docs/0.14/tags/security/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Self-hosting</title><link>https://go-slides.github.io/docs/0.14/self-hosting/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://go-slides.github.io/docs/0.14/self-hosting/</guid><description>
&lt;p&gt;The &lt;a href="https://go-slides.github.io/docs/0.14/playground/"&gt;playground&lt;/a&gt; is static files, and
&lt;a href="https://go-slides.github.io/docs/0.14/cli/"&gt;&lt;code&gt;slides --server&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/a&gt; is one process on the loopback. Both
can run on your own machine, behind your own name, for people who sign in
with your organisation&amp;rsquo;s account. This page does it with
&lt;a href="https://caddyserver.com/docs/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;Caddy&lt;/a&gt; (tested with v2.11.7), which obtains
and renews the HTTPS certificates itself, and
&lt;a href="https://oauth2-proxy.github.io/oauth2-proxy/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;oauth2-proxy&lt;/a&gt; for the
sign-in. Every file shown here is in
&lt;a href="https://github.com/go-slides/go-slides.github.io/tree/main/selfhost" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;&lt;code&gt;selfhost/&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/a&gt;,
and its CI checks each Caddyfile with &lt;code&gt;caddy validate&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 data-hextra-search-id="the-playground"&gt;The playground&lt;span class="hx:absolute hx:-mt-20" id="the-playground"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#the-playground" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Each release of the site attaches the whole site, playground included, as
one tarball built for the root of a domain, with its SHA-256:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-code-block hx:relative hx:mt-6 hx:first:mt-0 hx:group/code"&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-sh" data-lang="sh"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;curl -fLO https://github.com/go-slides/go-slides.github.io/releases/download/v0.1.0/go-slides-site-v0.1.0.tar.gz
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;curl -fLO https://github.com/go-slides/go-slides.github.io/releases/download/v0.1.0/go-slides-site-v0.1.0.tar.gz.sha256
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;sha256sum -c go-slides-site-v0.1.0.tar.gz.sha256
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;tar -xzf go-slides-site-v0.1.0.tar.gz -C /srv
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;mv /srv/go-slides-site-v0.1.0 /srv/go-slides-site&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="hextra-code-copy-btn-container hx:opacity-0 hx:transition hx:group-hover/code:opacity-100 hx:flex hx:gap-1 hx:absolute hx:m-[11px] hx:right-0 hx:top-0"&gt;
&lt;button
class="hextra-code-copy-btn hx:group/copybtn hx:cursor-pointer hx:transition-all hx:active:opacity-50 hx:bg-primary-700/5 hx:border hx:border-black/5 hx:text-gray-600 hx:hover:text-gray-900 hx:rounded-md hx:p-1.5 hx:dark:bg-primary-300/10 hx:dark:border-white/10 hx:dark:text-gray-400 hx:dark:hover:text-gray-50"
title="Copy code"
aria-label="Copy code"
data-copied-label="Copied!"
&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-copy-icon hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:hidden hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-success-icon hx:hidden hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:block hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/button&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The tarball is reproducible: building the same tag again gives the same
bytes. Beside every file that compresses (the WebAssembly modules, the
fonts, the pages, the scripts) it carries the same file compressed with
Brotli (&lt;code&gt;.br&lt;/code&gt;) and gzip (&lt;code&gt;.gz&lt;/code&gt;), so the server sends them as they are and
compresses nothing on the fly.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 data-hextra-search-id="caddyfile"&gt;Caddyfile&lt;span class="hx:absolute hx:-mt-20" id="caddyfile"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#caddyfile" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;code&gt;slides.example.org&lt;/code&gt; is your name. Its A and AAAA records point at the
machine, and ports 80 and 443 reach Caddy:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-code-block hx:relative hx:mt-6 hx:first:mt-0 hx:group/code"&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-caddy" data-lang="caddy"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="k"&gt;import&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="vm"&gt;headers.caddy&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="gh"&gt;slides.example.org&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="k"&gt;root&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nd"&gt;*&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="s"&gt;/srv/go-slides-site&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="k"&gt;file_server&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="k"&gt;precompressed&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="s"&gt;br&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="s"&gt;gzip&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="k"&gt;import&lt;/span&gt; playground_headers
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="hextra-code-copy-btn-container hx:opacity-0 hx:transition hx:group-hover/code:opacity-100 hx:flex hx:gap-1 hx:absolute hx:m-[11px] hx:right-0 hx:top-0"&gt;
&lt;button
class="hextra-code-copy-btn hx:group/copybtn hx:cursor-pointer hx:transition-all hx:active:opacity-50 hx:bg-primary-700/5 hx:border hx:border-black/5 hx:text-gray-600 hx:hover:text-gray-900 hx:rounded-md hx:p-1.5 hx:dark:bg-primary-300/10 hx:dark:border-white/10 hx:dark:text-gray-400 hx:dark:hover:text-gray-50"
title="Copy code"
aria-label="Copy code"
data-copied-label="Copied!"
&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-copy-icon hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:hidden hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-success-icon hx:hidden hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:block hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/button&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-code-block hx:relative hx:mt-6 hx:first:mt-0 hx:group/code"&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-sh" data-lang="sh"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;caddy run --config Caddyfile.playground&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="hextra-code-copy-btn-container hx:opacity-0 hx:transition hx:group-hover/code:opacity-100 hx:flex hx:gap-1 hx:absolute hx:m-[11px] hx:right-0 hx:top-0"&gt;
&lt;button
class="hextra-code-copy-btn hx:group/copybtn hx:cursor-pointer hx:transition-all hx:active:opacity-50 hx:bg-primary-700/5 hx:border hx:border-black/5 hx:text-gray-600 hx:hover:text-gray-900 hx:rounded-md hx:p-1.5 hx:dark:bg-primary-300/10 hx:dark:border-white/10 hx:dark:text-gray-400 hx:dark:hover:text-gray-50"
title="Copy code"
aria-label="Copy code"
data-copied-label="Copied!"
&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-copy-icon hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:hidden hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-success-icon hx:hidden hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:block hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/button&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The playground is then at &lt;code&gt;https://slides.example.org/playground/&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 data-hextra-search-id="what-the-server-must-get-right"&gt;What the server must get right&lt;span class="hx:absolute hx:-mt-20" id="what-the-server-must-get-right"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#what-the-server-must-get-right" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;HTTPS.&lt;/strong&gt; Caddy gets the certificate from Let&amp;rsquo;s Encrypt with ACME
(&lt;a href="https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc8555" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;RFC 8555&lt;/a&gt;), proving that it holds
the name by answering on port 80 (HTTP-01) or 443 (TLS-ALPN-01), and
renews it. A machine that the CA cannot reach can use the DNS-01
challenge instead (a TXT record, which needs a Caddy built with your DNS
provider&amp;rsquo;s module), or your own certificate with &lt;code&gt;tls cert.pem key.pem&lt;/code&gt;.
On a test machine, &lt;code&gt;tls internal&lt;/code&gt; uses Caddy&amp;rsquo;s local CA.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;code&gt;application/wasm&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/strong&gt; Caddy sends this type for &lt;code&gt;.wasm&lt;/code&gt;; another server
may need to be told. The playground compiles its modules from the bytes it
has read (the export engine as it downloads, in a response of its own
with that type), so it starts even from a server that sends another type;
with &lt;code&gt;nosniff&lt;/code&gt;, the right type is still the one to send.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compression.&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;code&gt;precompressed br gzip&lt;/code&gt; sends &lt;code&gt;playground.wasm.br&lt;/code&gt; to a
browser that accepts Brotli, &lt;code&gt;.gz&lt;/code&gt; to one that accepts gzip, and the file
itself otherwise, with &lt;code&gt;Vary: Accept-Encoding&lt;/code&gt;. The editor&amp;rsquo;s module is
about 7 MiB in Brotli, against 33 MiB uncompressed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Caching.&lt;/strong&gt; The page asks for every module, worker, font and picture
with the release in the query (&lt;code&gt;playground.wasm?v=v0.1.0&lt;/code&gt;), so those can
be kept for a year (&lt;code&gt;immutable&lt;/code&gt;). The pages themselves are revalidated
(&lt;code&gt;no-cache&lt;/code&gt;): a new release is seen at the next visit.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The headers in &lt;code&gt;headers.caddy&lt;/code&gt;:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-code-block hx:relative hx:mt-6 hx:first:mt-0 hx:group/code"&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-caddy" data-lang="caddy"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="nv"&gt;(playground_headers)&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="k"&gt;header&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="k"&gt;Content-Security-Policy&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;default-src &amp;#39;self&amp;#39;; script-src &amp;#39;self&amp;#39; &amp;#39;unsafe-inline&amp;#39; &amp;#39;wasm-unsafe-eval&amp;#39;; worker-src &amp;#39;self&amp;#39;; connect-src &amp;#39;self&amp;#39; https:; img-src &amp;#39;self&amp;#39; data: blob: https:; media-src &amp;#39;self&amp;#39; data: blob: https:; style-src &amp;#39;self&amp;#39; &amp;#39;unsafe-inline&amp;#39; https:; font-src &amp;#39;self&amp;#39; data: blob: https:; frame-src &amp;#39;self&amp;#39;; object-src &amp;#39;none&amp;#39;; base-uri &amp;#39;none&amp;#39;; form-action &amp;#39;none&amp;#39;; frame-ancestors &amp;#39;self&amp;#39;&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="k"&gt;X-Content-Type-Options&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="s"&gt;nosniff&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="k"&gt;Referrer-Policy&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="s"&gt;no-referrer&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="k"&gt;Strict-Transport-Security&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;max-age=31536000&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="nd"&gt;@versioned&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="k"&gt;query&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="s"&gt;v=*&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="k"&gt;header&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nd"&gt;@versioned&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="s"&gt;Cache-Control&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;public, max-age=31536000, immutable&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="nd"&gt;@unversioned&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="k"&gt;not&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="k"&gt;query&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="s"&gt;v=*&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="k"&gt;header&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nd"&gt;@unversioned&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="s"&gt;Cache-Control&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;no-cache&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="hextra-code-copy-btn-container hx:opacity-0 hx:transition hx:group-hover/code:opacity-100 hx:flex hx:gap-1 hx:absolute hx:m-[11px] hx:right-0 hx:top-0"&gt;
&lt;button
class="hextra-code-copy-btn hx:group/copybtn hx:cursor-pointer hx:transition-all hx:active:opacity-50 hx:bg-primary-700/5 hx:border hx:border-black/5 hx:text-gray-600 hx:hover:text-gray-900 hx:rounded-md hx:p-1.5 hx:dark:bg-primary-300/10 hx:dark:border-white/10 hx:dark:text-gray-400 hx:dark:hover:text-gray-50"
title="Copy code"
aria-label="Copy code"
data-copied-label="Copied!"
&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-copy-icon hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:hidden hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-success-icon hx:hidden hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:block hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/button&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The policy is the one the playground needs: its scripts (the loader is
inline), its WebAssembly (&lt;code&gt;'wasm-unsafe-eval'&lt;/code&gt;) and its worker, all from
your server. A deck&amp;rsquo;s pictures, style sheets and fonts may come from any
&lt;code&gt;https:&lt;/code&gt; address, as they do in the command&amp;rsquo;s output; drop &lt;code&gt;https:&lt;/code&gt; from
&lt;code&gt;img-src&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;style-src&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;font-src&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;media-src&lt;/code&gt; and &lt;code&gt;connect-src&lt;/code&gt; to keep
every request on your server, and decks that point elsewhere show without
those resources. The deck itself runs in iframes sandboxed without your
origin, under a stricter policy of their own that the playground writes
into each frame: it cannot reach the playground, its storage or your
cookies, whatever this header says. &lt;code&gt;frame-ancestors 'self'&lt;/code&gt; stops other
sites from framing the playground.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;No COOP or COEP.&lt;/strong&gt; The playground uses neither &lt;code&gt;SharedArrayBuffer&lt;/code&gt; nor
threads, so it does not need to be cross-origin isolated. Sending
&lt;code&gt;Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy: require-corp&lt;/code&gt; would block a deck&amp;rsquo;s pictures
from other sites.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 data-hextra-search-id="without-the-network"&gt;Without the network&lt;span class="hx:absolute hx:-mt-20" id="without-the-network"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#without-the-network" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;Once the page is loaded, everything happens in the browser: the editor,
the preview, the presenter view, and the PDF, PPTX and ODP exports, whose
fonts are in the tarball. The deck is sent neither to your server nor
anywhere else. What needs the network is what the deck names: pictures or
style sheets at an &lt;code&gt;https:&lt;/code&gt; address, and the &lt;code&gt;gaia&lt;/code&gt; theme&amp;rsquo;s web font, which
it asks of &lt;code&gt;fonts.bunny.net&lt;/code&gt; (without it, the slides fall back to another
font). The links to this documentation leave your server.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 data-hextra-search-id="slides---server-behind-the-proxy"&gt;&lt;code&gt;slides --server&lt;/code&gt; behind the proxy&lt;span class="hx:absolute hx:-mt-20" id="slides---server-behind-the-proxy"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#slides---server-behind-the-proxy" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;code&gt;slides --server&lt;/code&gt; stays on &lt;code&gt;127.0.0.1&lt;/code&gt; and Caddy forwards to it. The server
checks the &lt;code&gt;Host&lt;/code&gt; header of each request and the &lt;code&gt;Origin&lt;/code&gt; of each live
reload&amp;rsquo;s WebSocket, against DNS rebinding and other sites&amp;rsquo; pages, and the
proxy keeps the public name in both. &lt;code&gt;--allowed-host&lt;/code&gt; adds that name to
what the checks accept; they stay on:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-code-block hx:relative hx:mt-6 hx:first:mt-0 hx:group/code"&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-sh" data-lang="sh"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;slides -s --allowed-host decks.example.org /srv/decks&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="hextra-code-copy-btn-container hx:opacity-0 hx:transition hx:group-hover/code:opacity-100 hx:flex hx:gap-1 hx:absolute hx:m-[11px] hx:right-0 hx:top-0"&gt;
&lt;button
class="hextra-code-copy-btn hx:group/copybtn hx:cursor-pointer hx:transition-all hx:active:opacity-50 hx:bg-primary-700/5 hx:border hx:border-black/5 hx:text-gray-600 hx:hover:text-gray-900 hx:rounded-md hx:p-1.5 hx:dark:bg-primary-300/10 hx:dark:border-white/10 hx:dark:text-gray-400 hx:dark:hover:text-gray-50"
title="Copy code"
aria-label="Copy code"
data-copied-label="Copied!"
&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-copy-icon hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:hidden hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-success-icon hx:hidden hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:block hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/button&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-code-block hx:relative hx:mt-6 hx:first:mt-0 hx:group/code"&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-caddy" data-lang="caddy"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="gh"&gt;decks.example.org&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="k"&gt;reverse_proxy&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;127.0.0.1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mi"&gt;8080&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="hextra-code-copy-btn-container hx:opacity-0 hx:transition hx:group-hover/code:opacity-100 hx:flex hx:gap-1 hx:absolute hx:m-[11px] hx:right-0 hx:top-0"&gt;
&lt;button
class="hextra-code-copy-btn hx:group/copybtn hx:cursor-pointer hx:transition-all hx:active:opacity-50 hx:bg-primary-700/5 hx:border hx:border-black/5 hx:text-gray-600 hx:hover:text-gray-900 hx:rounded-md hx:p-1.5 hx:dark:bg-primary-300/10 hx:dark:border-white/10 hx:dark:text-gray-400 hx:dark:hover:text-gray-50"
title="Copy code"
aria-label="Copy code"
